# ⏱️ Time Complexity

| Operation  | Priority Queue |
| ---------- | -------------: |
| Insert     |       O(log n) |
| Remove top |       O(log n) |
| Get top    |           O(1) |
| Size       |           O(1) |

Why?

When you insert/remove an element, the heap may need to rearrange itself.

```text
Insert → rearrange → O(log n)

Remove top → rearrange → O(log n)

Get top → already at top → O(1)
```

