# 🧠 Remember All Your Containers

You've now covered a really useful set:

```text
Vector / ArrayList / List
        ↓
Dynamic array

LinkedList
        ↓
Nodes connected together

Stack
        ↓
LIFO

Queue
        ↓
FIFO

Deque
        ↓
Both ends

Priority Queue
        ↓
Highest/lowest priority first
```

### One-line memory trick 🔥

```text
Stack          → Last In First Out
Queue          → First In First Out
Deque          → Both Ends
Priority Queue → Priority First
```

And the **biggest thing to remember across languages**:

```text
C++       → Max Heap by default
Java      → Min Heap by default
Python    → Min Heap by default
```

That's the one that'll save you from a lot of "why the hell did 5 come out first?" moments 😄 





